<http://data.silknow.org/object/33c3f10a-452c-3dea-a661-8bd150a2a9ec/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Walking length umbrella of silk with a carved, acorn shaped, amber handle with a gold collar claw set with small diamonds. It has a gold mount and there is a pin that goes through it. \n\nThe cover is of black silk, with a scallop openwork net insertion border, outlined with a floral border in couched cord. It is unlined.\n\nThe ribs are hollow, cast, black japanned metal and the rib tips are of the same. There is a holding band fastening with a smoked pearl button."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/33c3f10a-452c-3dea-a661-8bd150a2a9ec> .

